abstract: "An open library of tax guides, source-cited drafts and accountant-reviewed guides signed by named licensed practitioners, structured so any AI agent can cite and apply them. Counts are in index.json. The software is AGPL-3.0-only; the guides are under the source-available OA Guide License (see LICENSING.md)."
